<h1>Hardware Settings - Real Time Processing Tab</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description: Real Time Processing</b></span> tab allows changes in processing options during scanning.</p>
<p><img src="../Images/realtime_processing.bmp" width="551px" height="488px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p class="sub-head">Profiles <a href="Profiles_in_HW_settings_(MMX,_MMZ,_MMC).htm"><img src="../../../../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></a></p>
<p class="parameterdescription">&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">Maximum point spacing</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'Between stripes'</b></span> option</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Specifies the distance between stripes. Enter a number in mm. Default value is 5mm.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'Between points on the same stripe'</b></span> option</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Specifies the distance between points within a stripe. Enter a number in mm. Default value is 2mm.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">Linear (1D) sampling</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'Use one point in'</b></span> &#160;box</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Defines how many of the points obtained while scanning, are used. If the value entered is 1, every point on the stripe will be used, if the value is 2, every second point on each stripe is used. Default value is 1.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Linear sampling is disabled by default.</p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a2" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></p>
