<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">Scanning speed</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Choose the scanning speed. Options depends on the series of sensor to be used:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">For C series: 15Hz and 30 Hz</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">Certified Settings checkbox</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">When this option is enabled all settings in the tab are set to their default values. For the best results, it is recommended to use 'Certified settings'.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">When all changes are made, confirm with <span class="Button">Apply</span> button.</p>
